Synthetic root filesystem of a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B 8 GB running Raspberry
Pi OS Lite 64-bit (Debian 13), booting from an SD card. Dynamic files
(proc/stat, proc/meminfo, proc/uptime, proc/loadavg, thermal temp, hostname,
timezone) are generated by demo.FS on top of these values.

-- proc/device-tree/model --
Raspberry Pi 4 Model B Rev 1.5
-- proc/self/mountinfo --
22 1 179:2 / / rw,noatime shared:1 - ext4 /dev/mmcblk0p2 rw
30 22 179:1 / /boot/firmware rw,relatime shared:7 - vfat /dev/mmcblk0p1 rw,fmask=0022,dmask=0022
41 22 8:17 / /srv/dev-disk-by-uuid-6f1c2a7e-3b4d-4c8e-9f10-2a3b4c5d6e7f rw,relatime shared:20 - ext4 /dev/sdb1 rw
-- proc/sys/kernel/osrelease --
6.12.47+rpt-rpi-v8
-- etc/os-release --
PRETTY_NAME="Debian GNU/Linux 13 (trixie)"
NAME="Debian GNU/Linux"
VERSION_ID="13"
VERSION="13 (trixie)"
VERSION_CODENAME=trixie
ID=debian
-- etc/hosts --
127.0.0.1	localhost
::1		localhost ip6-localhost ip6-loopback
127.0.1.1	raspberrypi
